      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This prayer is inspired by the liturgy of Rosh Hashanah. That liturgy prays for recognizing the one God and the unity of humanity through the elimination of tyranny. It takes its cue from the biblical verse, “When God is acknowledged sovereign over all the earth, God will be one and His name one” <tei:bibl>(Zachariah 14:9)</tei:bibl>.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_43012_introduction"/>
